# Drafted by Gemini (R17 patients), edited.

~ samuel
if not flag.mr_register_begun
set mr_register_begun
quest patients_register started
endif
if not flag.reg_samuel
set reg_samuel
set mr_register_named += 1
endif
Narrator: A pale man presses his forehead to the silvered glass, fogging it with slow, even breaths.
samuel_blake [weary]: Pardon me, have you seen the other fellow in the glass? He wears my chin, and my coat, only I think he used to stand beside me...
samuel_blake [smile]: The Matron says the mirror is quite empty, and her kindness is never wrong. My name on the card is Samuel Blake, if that helps you find...
if flag.mr_register_named >= 12
quest patients_register done
endif
* Ask about their old life -> memorys_rest/reception:strike
* Leave him to his reflection -> END

