Narrator: He tilts a polished tin cup toward the violet lamp, watching his own eyes swim in the metal.
thomas_adams [weary]: Good evening, friends, my card says Thomas Adams, from the foster house on the hill. I keep looking in the window for a boy with another surname, though he had my exact face...
thomas_adams [smile]: The Matron tells me one face is plenty for a quiet life. Still, when I look at my hands, it feels as though there ought to be four of...
if flag.mr_register_named >= 12
quest patients_register done
endif
* Ask about their old life -> memorys_rest/reception:strike
* Leave him in peace -> END

~ victor
if not flag.mr_register_begun
