if not flag.reg_victor
set reg_victor
set mr_register_named += 1
endif
if not flag.mr_clue_victor
set mr_clue_victor
set mr_truth_clues += 1
if flag.mr_truth_clues >= 2 and (quest.all_is_well == find_the_cousin or quest.all_is_well == sign_in)
quest all_is_well the_truth
endif
endif
Narrator: He strokes his own forearm with two gentle fingers, following the blue tracks of his veins.
victor_lane [afraid]: Do pardon my sleeves, the chart at my bed calls me Victor Lane. Something soft is uncurling under the skin, like pale rootlets drinking up the rain...
victor_lane [smile]: The Matron promises the tickling is only the cure settling into the bone. Soon I shall be quite light, and hollow, and nothing will ache at...
if flag.mr_register_named >= 12
quest patients_register done
endif
* Ask about their old life -> memorys_rest/reception:strike
* Step quietly away -> END

