emily_hale [smile]: Mind the carpet, please, I have nearly turned it to the middle. The nurse told me I am Emily Hale, and she gives me buttered toast when I sit still...
emily_hale [weary]: Everything goes round and down toward the centre, you see, like water in a basin. Once you reach the very middle, the Matron says you never have to climb back...
if flag.mr_register_named >= 12
quest patients_register done
