wendy_holden [sad]: I am so dreadfully sorry about the gate, my dear, I truly thought I latched it. Oh, pardon me, visitors, my ribbon says Wendy Holden...
wendy_holden [smile]: There is no one in that chair, is there, and the Matron says nobody is angry with me now. It is such a mercy, not knowing who I failed to...
